+---
+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Add an opt-in private timing phase around the short HTTP client's actual connector. Owned trace context follows the request without global state; legacy observers keep the original connector path. Connection results, errors, timeouts and cancellation are retained, and diagnostics omit request and endpoint values. The direct Tower dependency uses the already locked package and features.
